# Pub mirror (Runflare — local only)

Use the **Runflare** mirror for **local** `flutter` / `dart pub` in this repo. **Do not** use `pub-azs.ir` or other mirrors unless the user explicitly overrides.

**GitHub Actions and other remote CI** use default `pub.dev` / Google storage hosts — do **not** set Runflare env vars in `.github/workflows/`.

## Local env (before any flutter/dart command)

```bash
source tool/pub_env.sh
```

Defaults (forced locally — overrides shell pub-azs or other mirrors):

- `PUB_HOSTED_URL=https://mirror-flutter.runflare.com`
- `FLUTTER_STORAGE_BASE_URL=https://mirror-gcs.runflare.com`

## Agents & scripts

- `./tool/ci_verify.sh` sources `tool/pub_env.sh` automatically (local verify only).
- Local `pubspec.lock` may show Runflare URLs after `pub get`; CI resolves from `pub.dev` without mirror env.

## Do not

- Add Runflare mirror env to GitHub Actions or other remote CI.
- Switch local mirrors to pub-azs or pub.dev without user request.
- Commit machine-specific mirror config that overrides Runflare for the whole team locally.
